cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use PyroPPI, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "PyroPPI: hierarchical Bayesian modelling of PPI Recorder screens"
abstract: >-
  PyroPPI estimates an interaction propensity for each protein pair measured by
  PPI Recorder, a pooled two-hybrid assay that reads protein interactions out of
  a CRISPR base editor. The model separates the propensity from the increments a
  drug or a cell line adds, and partially pools across pairs so that sparsely
  sampled pairs are drawn toward the population.
type: software
authors:
